stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Streaming : user sends a message
    Streaming --> Complete : done event
    Streaming --> Failed : explained failure (AgentExecutionError, provider error)
    Streaming --> Failed : stream cancelled, message "Cancelled by user"
    Streaming --> Failed : internal error, recorded then re-raised
    Complete --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]
    note right of Streaming
        One streaming turn per chat session:
        start_turn refuses a second.
    end note
    note right of Failed
        Stored as status error with its message.
        Later requests still see it, with that message
        in place of an answer (provider_messages).
    end note
